{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Office After Hours is a 1-2 hours light horror experience with scary and funny anomalies set in a mysterious story.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">You just want to go home. Why are you still here?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your boss has insisted on extra overtime and now you're stuck in the office after work. Keep an eye out for strange occurrences and you might find your way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207300/extras/fc852a0f5c75d8bedf8558f8353b809d.poster.avif?t=1764755581\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207300/extras/fc852a0f5c75d8bedf8558f8353b809d.webm?t=1764755581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Spot anomalies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">During your shift, the office will change and you will discover a lot of work, coffee and, if you are lucky, the office pet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Escape the overwork hell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">To escape from Endless Solutions, you must find clues that will give you access to new areas and reveal new secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Can you find all the numbers and collect the story-related items?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207300/extras/cdad97bd6cb3c381a6077fe0dd4539e5.poster.avif?t=1764755581\" width=795 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207300/extras/cdad97bd6cb3c381a6077fe0dd4539e5.webm?t=1764755581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Can you escape?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">30 Story based anomalies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">40+ Anomalies in total</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Working hours</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">~1-2 hours (+overtime)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Additional Content: Crossovertime Mode\u271d\ufe0f\ud83d\udd04\u231b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover 7 major anomalies - one hiding 4 smaller ones. References to other anomaly games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No punishment for missing anomalies, just pure exploration and fun encounters. (~15\u201325 min)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207300/extras/c60929aa0c27528c7c1c10c4204fa0f4.poster.avif?t=1764755581\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207300/extras/c60929aa0c27528c7c1c10c4204fa0f4.webm?t=1764755581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Corporate Puppet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3207300/a501633502e8eeb0419bb674b61f60e62d634839.jpg"},{"name":"Office Plague Carrier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3207300/18e6d43b08d234b27e716c0a31ac1cd9f4a80080.jpg"},{"name":"Office Detective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/stea